    "Does what Escape does on this page (the page blueprint, layer \"Close the page on Escape\"): over a running game Clear Page returns to the story; from the title page Go back returns to the title.": "与本页面按 Esc 键的效果相同（页面蓝图的「按 Esc 键关闭页面」图层）：游戏运行时由「关闭全部页面」回到故事；从标题页打开时由「返回上一页」回到标题页。",
    "Does what Escape does on this page when no picture is open (the page blueprint, layer \"Close the picture or the page on Escape\"). This page is opened only from the title page, so Go back returns there.": "与本页面在没有打开图片时按 Esc 键的效果相同（页面蓝图的「按 Esc 键关闭图片或页面」图层）。本页面只从标题页打开，因此「返回上一页」回到标题页。",
    "Empty note": "空列表提示",
