    "Entry rule": "条目分隔线",
    "Escape is bound to the Dismiss action (Input actions panel), and this page answers it. Over a running game, Clear Page closes every page above the story and the player is back in it. From the title page there is no game, so Clear Page does nothing and Go back returns to the title. The Back button on the left runs the same two nodes.": "Esc 键绑定在「关闭」输入意图上（「输入意图」面板），本页面响应该意图。游戏运行时，「关闭全部页面」关闭故事之上的所有页面，玩家回到故事中。从标题页打开时没有正在运行的游戏，「关闭全部页面」不起作用，由「返回上一页」回到标题页。左侧的「返回」按钮使用同样的两个节点。",
    "Escape is bound to the Dismiss action (Input actions panel), and this page answers it. With a picture open in Viewer, it hides Viewer and the page stays. With none open, Clear Page and Go back leave the page, as the Back button on the left does.": "Esc 键绑定在「关闭」输入意图上（「输入意图」面板），本页面响应该意图。「查看器」中打开着图片时，隐藏「查看器」，页面保留。没有打开图片时，由「关闭全部页面」和「返回上一页」离开本页面，与左侧的「返回」按钮相同。",
