    "Runs as the player drags the slider. The slider's 0–100 is the text speed in characters per second, and the number beside it shows it rounded. Memo keeps the value because one output can feed only one input, and two nodes use it here.": "玩家拖动滑块时运行。滑块的 0–100 就是每秒显示的字数，右侧的数字显示四舍五入后的值。一个输出只能接入一个输入，而这里有两个节点要用到这个值，所以先用「暂存」保存它。",
    "Runs each time the page opens. Shows Text pane, hides Sound pane and lights the Text button (Selected variant), so the page always opens on the text settings. The Text and Sound buttons switch panes the same way when pressed. To open on Sound instead, swap the two Visible values and the two variants.": "每次打开页面时运行：显示「文字面板」，隐藏「声音面板」，并把「文字」按钮设为「选中」变体，因此页面总是先显示文字设置。按下「文字」和「声音」按钮时以同样的方式切换面板。若要改为先显示声音设置，交换两个「可见／隐藏」值和两个变体即可。",
    "Runs each time this list is shown; a hidden list is not drawn, so its button on the left draws it again and it shows what is unlocked by then. Get Gallery hands over the CG entries of the Gallery panel (left rail), each row carrying its lock state, its picture and its name, masked while locked. A new project has none, so the list starts empty and Empty note says so. An Unlock Gallery node in the story unlocks an entry. The four lists run this same layer with their own Kind and empty text. They are not one component: Kind is picked on the node and has no pin, so a component param cannot set it, and each list lays out its rows differently.": "每次显示本列表时运行；隐藏的列表不会绘制，所以按下左侧对应的按钮会重新绘制它，并显示到那时为止已解锁的内容。「获取画廊条目」取出「画廊」面板（左侧图标栏）中的 CG 条目，每一行都带有锁定状态、图片和名称（锁定时名称被遮住）。新项目没有条目，列表为空，由「空列表提示」说明。故事中的「解锁画廊条目」节点会解锁条目。四个列表运行同样的图层，只是各自的「类型」和空列表文字不同。它们没有做成一个组件：「类型」只能在节点上选择，没有引脚，组件参数无法设置它；而且每个列表排列行的方式也不同。",
    "Runs each time this list is shown; a hidden list is not drawn, so its button on the left draws it again and it shows what is unlocked by then. Get Gallery hands over the music entries of the Gallery panel (left rail), each row carrying its lock state, its track and its name, masked while locked. A new project has none, so the list starts empty and Empty note says so. Playing a track in the story unlocks it. The four lists run this same layer with their own Kind and empty text. They are not one component: Kind is picked on the node and has no pin, so a component param cannot set it, and each list lays out its rows differently.": "每次显示本列表时运行；隐藏的列表不会绘制，所以按下左侧对应的按钮会重新绘制它，并显示到那时为止已解锁的内容。「获取画廊条目」取出「画廊」面板（左侧图标栏）中的音乐条目，每一行都带有锁定状态、曲目和名称（锁定时名称被遮住）。新项目没有条目，列表为空，由「空列表提示」说明。故事中播放某首曲目时解锁该曲目。四个列表运行同样的图层，只是各自的「类型」和空列表文字不同。它们没有做成一个组件：「类型」只能在节点上选择，没有引脚，组件参数无法设置它；而且每个列表排列行的方式也不同。",
    "Runs each time this list is shown; a hidden list is not drawn, so its button on the left draws it again and it shows what is unlocked by then. Get Gallery hands over the recollection entries of the Gallery panel (left rail), each row carrying its lock state, its picture and its name, masked while locked. A new project has none, so the list starts empty and Empty note says so. Reaching an entry's scene in the story unlocks it. The four lists run this same layer with their own Kind and empty text. They are not one component: Kind is picked on the node and has no pin, so a component param cannot set it, and each list lays out its rows differently.": "每次显示本列表时运行；隐藏的列表不会绘制，所以按下左侧对应的按钮会重新绘制它，并显示到那时为止已解锁的内容。「获取画廊条目」取出「画廊」面板（左侧图标栏）中的回想条目，每一行都带有锁定状态、图片和名称（锁定时名称被遮住）。新项目没有条目，列表为空，由「空列表提示」说明。故事进入条目对应的场景时解锁该条目。四个列表运行同样的图层，只是各自的「类型」和空列表文字不同。它们没有做成一个组件：「类型」只能在节点上选择，没有引脚，组件参数无法设置它；而且每个列表排列行的方式也不同。",
    "Runs each time this list is shown; a hidden list is not drawn, so its button on the left draws it again and it shows what is unlocked by then. Get Gallery hands over the voice entries of the Gallery panel (left rail), each row carrying its lock state, its line and its name, masked while locked. A new project has none, so the list starts empty and Empty note says so. Hearing a line in the story unlocks it. The four lists run this same layer with their own Kind and empty text. They are not one component: Kind is picked on the node and has no pin, so a component param cannot set it, and each list lays out its rows differently.": "每次显示本列表时运行；隐藏的列表不会绘制，所以按下左侧对应的按钮会重新绘制它，并显示到那时为止已解锁的内容。「获取画廊条目」取出「画廊」面板（左侧图标栏）中的语音条目，每一行都带有锁定状态、台词和名称（锁定时名称被遮住）。新项目没有条目，列表为空，由「空列表提示」说明。故事中听到某句台词时解锁该台词。四个列表运行同样的图层，只是各自的「类型」和空列表文字不同。它们没有做成一个组件：「类型」只能在节点上选择，没有引脚，组件参数无法设置它；而且每个列表排列行的方式也不同。",
    "Runs once for each card, with that card's own Scene and Name key params (set on each instance). A scene the player has reached shows its picture and its name, read from the localization table with Name key; one not reached yet hides both and shows Locked mark. The template places no card: the Recollection grid on the Extra page lists its scenes from the Gallery panel instead.": "对每张卡片运行一次，使用该卡片自己的「场景」和「名称键」参数（在每个实例上设置）。玩家到达过的场景显示插图和名称，名称按「名称键」从本地化表中读取；尚未到达的场景隐藏两者，显示「锁定标记」。模板中没有摆放这张卡片：「鉴赏」页面的「回想网格」改为从「画廊」面板列出场景。",
    "Runs when a card is pressed. A card whose scene the player has reached plays the confirm cue and starts the game at that scene; one not reached yet stays silent and does nothing, which is why the cue comes after the check.": "按下卡片时运行。玩家到达过该场景的卡片播放确认音，并在该场景开始游戏；尚未到达的卡片不发声，也不做任何事，因此确认音放在判断之后。",
    "Runs when a row is pressed. A locked row does nothing; an unlocked one plays the row's clip on the Voice track, so the Voice slider on the Config page sets its volume. Music rows does the same on the Music track. The two are not one component: the track is picked on Play Sound and has no pin, so a param cannot set it.": "按下某行时运行。锁定的行不做任何事；已解锁的行在 Voice 音轨上播放该行的语音，音量由「设置」页面的「语音」滑块控制。「音乐列表」在 Music 音轨上做同样的事。两者没有做成一个组件：音轨只能在「播放声音」节点上选择，没有引脚，参数无法设置它。",
    "Runs when a row is pressed. A locked row does nothing; an unlocked one plays the row's track on the Music track, so the BGM slider on the Config page sets its volume. Voice rows does the same on the Voice track. The two are not one component: the track is picked on Play Sound and has no pin, so a param cannot set it.": "按下某行时运行。锁定的行不做任何事；已解锁的行在 Music 音轨上播放该行的曲目，音量由「设置」页面的「背景音乐」滑块控制。「语音列表」在 Voice 音轨上做同样的事。两者没有做成一个组件：音轨只能在「播放声音」节点上选择，没有引脚，参数无法设置它。",
    "Runs when a tile is pressed. A locked tile does nothing and plays nothing. An unlocked one plays the confirm cue and starts the game at the entry's scene, read off the row. Start Game replaces any game in progress, which is why this page opens only from the title page.": "按下格子时运行。锁定的格子不做任何事，也不发声。已解锁的格子播放确认音，并从该行读取场景，在该场景开始游戏。「开始游戏」会取代正在进行的游戏，因此本页面只从标题页打开。",
    "Runs when a tile is pressed. A locked tile does nothing and plays nothing. An unlocked one plays the confirm cue, then keeps in the page variables (Extra page blueprint) which artwork it is, how many variants it has and where the pressed picture sits among them, puts the row's picture in Viewer and shows Viewer. Viewer's own blueprint steps through the variants from there.": "按下格子时运行。锁定的格子不做任何事，也不发声。已解锁的格子先播放确认音，然后把它是哪个条目、有几个差分、按下的图片在差分中的位置记在页面变量中（「鉴赏」页面蓝图），把该行的图片放进「查看器」并显示「查看器」。之后由「查看器」自己的蓝图逐张切换差分。",
    "Runs when the open picture is clicked. It steps on from the picture on screen (Viewer variant) one variant at a time, wrapping round after the last, and shows the first one the player has unlocked; a locked one is skipped by going round the loop again. Coming back to the picture it opened on (Viewer first variant) closes Viewer. The page variables are set when a CG tile is pressed (CG grid, layer \"Open the picture\").": "点击打开着的图片时运行。从屏幕上的图片（「查看器当前差分」）开始逐个向后切换差分，到最后一个后回到开头，显示玩家已解锁的第一张；锁定的差分通过再走一圈循环跳过。回到打开时的那张图片（「查看器起始差分」）时关闭「查看器」。这些页面变量在按下 CG 格子时设置（「CG 网格」的「打开图片」图层）。",
    "Runs when the page opens, for each instance: puts the slider and the number at the volume saved for its track (multiply by 100).": "页面打开时对每个实例运行：把滑块和数字设为该音轨已保存的音量（乘以 100）。",
    "Runs when the page opens. Logo fades in with the page and the first long Delay holds it; it is hidden, Disclaimer is shown and held by the second, and Title opens once Disclaimer is hidden. A long wait counts from the start of the fade in (set in each element's Animation section); the short ones let the fade out finish. Advance (a click, Space or Enter) and Dismiss (Escape) end the long wait that is running, so the element on screen fades out at once. Skip Delay reaches a Delay through its Token pin, which is why the presses are handled in this layer. Replace Page closes this page as it opens Title, so Go back and Go Page set to None return to Title, not here. Disclaimer starts hidden: show it in the UI Outline to edit it, then hide it again. For an image logo, put an Image element in Logo in place of Wordmark.": "打开页面时运行。「标志」随页面淡入，由第一个较长的「延迟」保持，随后隐藏；接着显示「免责声明」，由第二个较长的「延迟」保持，隐藏后打开标题页。较长的等待从开始淡入时算起（淡入在各元素的「动画」分区中设置），较短的等待留给淡出。「推进」意图（单击、空格键或回车键）与「关闭」意图（Esc 键）会结束正在进行的较长等待，屏幕上的元素随即淡出。「跳过延迟」通过「令牌」引脚找到对应的「延迟」，因此按键也在本图层中处理。「替换页面」在打开标题页的同时关闭本页面，因此「返回上一页」与页面为「无」的「前往页面」都回到标题页，而不是这里。「免责声明」默认隐藏：编辑时在「UI 大纲」中显示它，编辑后再隐藏。若要使用图片标志，在「标志」中用「图片」元素替换「文字标志」。",
    "Runs when the page opens. Reads the skip setting the player saved, so a returning player sees the choice they left: Read only is lit when only read text is skipped, All text otherwise. Pressing either button changes the setting and the highlight in that button's own blueprint. This is the pattern for any pair of buttons that shows a saved choice; the two layers below repeat it for full screen and for muting when unfocused.": "打开页面时运行。读取玩家保存的跳过设置，让再次打开页面的玩家看到自己上次的选择：仅跳过已读文本时点亮「仅已读」，否则点亮「全部文本」。按下其中一个按钮时，由该按钮自己的蓝图修改设置并切换高亮。凡是用一对按钮显示已保存选项的地方都可以照此编写，下面两个图层对全屏和失去焦点时静音做了同样的事。",
    "Runs when the page opens: converts the saved delay back to the slider's 0–100 (divide by 20) and shows the same number as the layer above.": "页面打开时运行：把已保存的等待时间换算回滑块的 0–100（除以 20），并显示与上一个图层相同的数字。",
    "Runs when the page opens: converts the saved delay back to the slider's 0–100 (divide by 60) and shows the same number as the layer above.": "页面打开时运行：把已保存的等待时间换算回滑块的 0–100（除以 60），并显示与上一个图层相同的数字。",
    "Runs when the page opens: converts the saved volume back to 0–100 (multiply by 100) for the slider and the number.": "页面打开时运行：把已保存的音量换算回 0–100（乘以 100），用于滑块和数字。",
    "Runs when the page opens: puts the slider and the number at the speed the player saved, so a returning player sees their own setting.": "页面打开时运行：把滑块和数字设为玩家保存的速度，让再次打开页面的玩家看到自己的设置。",
    "Same pattern again, for muting the game while its window is in the background.": "同样的写法，用于游戏窗口处于后台时是否静音。",
    "Same pattern as the skip setting, for full screen: On is lit in full screen, Off in a window. Get Fullscreen asks the game window, so it sits on the execution wire before If instead of feeding the condition by itself.": "与跳过设置相同的写法，用于全屏：全屏时点亮「开」，窗口模式时点亮「关」。「获取全屏状态」需要询问游戏窗口，因此它接在执行线上、位于「如果」之前，而不是单独接入条件。",
