    "Shows this button's list, hides the other three and moves the highlight here (Selected variant on this button, Default on the other three). A list that is shown is drawn again, and its own blueprint fills it as it appears. The four buttons run this same graph with their own list and button. They are not one component: each shows its own label, and every instance of a component draws its definition's label.": "显示本按钮对应的列表，隐藏另外三个列表，并把高亮移到本按钮（本按钮设为「选中」变体，另外三个设为「默认」）。列表显示时会重新绘制，由列表自己的蓝图在出现时填充内容。四个按钮运行同样的图，只是各自的列表和按钮不同。它们没有做成一个组件：每个按钮显示各自的标签，而组件的每个实例都显示组件定义中的标签。",
    "Shows this button's pane, hides the other one and moves the highlight here (Selected variant on this button, Default on the other). When the page opens, the page's own blueprint shows the Text pane the same way.": "显示本按钮对应的面板，隐藏另一个面板，并把高亮移到本按钮（本按钮设为「选中」变体，另一个设为「默认」）。页面打开时，由页面自己的蓝图以同样方式显示文字面板。",
